```html
<!-- text-editor.component.html -->
<h1>{{ title }}</h1>
<textarea [formControl]="content" rows="5"></textarea>
<button (click)="addTreeItem()">Add Tree Item</button>
<ul>
  <li *ngFor="let item of treeList.items">{{ item.label }}</li>
</ul>
```

4. Add the necessary CSS styles:

```css
/* text-editor.component.css */
textarea {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100px;
}

ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
}

li {
  margin-bottom: 5px;
}
```

